Require:
  - :equality
Predicate:
  + (equal object object)
Action:
  - disembark-truck: ?driver - object ?truck - object ?loc - object
      pre: (and (at ?truck ?loc) (driver ?driver) (driving ?driver ?truck) (location ?loc) (not (= ?driver ?truck)) (truck ?truck))
      eff: (and (at ?driver ?loc) (empty ?truck) (not (driving ?driver ?truck)))
  + disembark-truck: ?driver - object ?truck - object ?loc - object
      pre: (and (at ?truck ?loc) (driver ?driver) (driving ?driver ?truck) (location ?loc) (not (equal ?driver ?truck)) (truck ?truck))
      eff: (and (at ?driver ?loc) (empty ?truck) (not (driving ?driver ?truck)))
  - drive-truck: ?truck - object ?loc-from - object ?loc-to - object ?driver - object
      pre: (and (at ?truck ?loc-from) (driver ?driver) (driving ?driver ?truck) (link ?loc-from ?loc-to) (location ?loc-from) (location ?loc-to) (not (= ?truck ?driver)) (truck ?truck))
      eff: (and (at ?truck ?loc-to) (not (at ?truck ?loc-from)))
  + drive-truck: ?truck - object ?loc-from - object ?loc-to - object ?driver - object
      pre: (and (at ?truck ?loc-from) (driver ?driver) (driving ?driver ?truck) (link ?loc-from ?loc-to) (location ?loc-from) (location ?loc-to) (not (equal ?truck ?driver)) (truck ?truck))
      eff: (and (at ?truck ?loc-to) (not (at ?truck ?loc-from)))
  - unload-truck: ?obj - object ?truck - object ?loc - object
      pre: (and (at ?truck ?loc) (in ?obj ?truck) (location ?loc) (not (= ?obj ?truck)) (obj ?obj) (truck ?truck))
      eff: (and (at ?obj ?loc) (not (in ?obj ?truck)))
  + unload-truck: ?obj - object ?truck - object ?loc - object
      pre: (and (at ?truck ?loc) (in ?obj ?truck) (location ?loc) (not (equal ?obj ?truck)) (obj ?obj) (truck ?truck))
      eff: (and (at ?obj ?loc) (not (in ?obj ?truck)))
Init:
  + (equal driver1 driver1)
  + (equal driver2 driver2)
  + (equal p1-0 p1-0)
  + (equal p1-4 p1-4)
  + (equal p1-5 p1-5)
  + (equal p2-1 p2-1)
  + (equal p2-3 p2-3)
  + (equal p3-0 p3-0)
  + (equal p3-1 p3-1)
  + (equal p3-5 p3-5)
  + (equal p4-5 p4-5)
  + (equal package1 package1)
  + (equal package2 package2)
  + (equal package3 package3)
  + (equal package4 package4)
  + (equal package5 package5)
  + (equal package6 package6)
  + (equal s0 s0)
  + (equal s1 s1)
  + (equal s2 s2)
  + (equal s3 s3)
  + (equal s4 s4)
  + (equal s5 s5)
  + (equal truck1 truck1)
  + (equal truck2 truck2)
  + (equal truck3 truck3)
Pred prop:
  - (= object object): in_pre in_pre_neg
  + (equal object object): in_init in_pre in_pre_neg
Global prop:
  - has_eq_pred
